$Mission Desc:
 XSTR("[[Duration: ~10 min | Difficulty: Easy]] The Theseus's deck boss wants every pilot's gunnery on record. The Cylotron drones are out on the range: first a row of parked Mark IX targets, then Mark X drones on a run, then a fast pass. Nothing shoots back.", -1)
$end_multi_text

