#Briefing
$start_briefing
$num_stages: 1
$start_stage
$multi_text
 XSTR("The Theseus's deck boss wants every pilot's gunnery on record. The Cylotron drones are out on the range: first a row of parked Mark IX targets, then Mark X drones on a run, then a fast pass. Nothing shoots back. Objectives. Destroy the six Mark IX drones. Destroy the six Mark X drones on their run. Destroy the four sprinting drones.", -1)
$end_multi_text
$voice: XM-Range-B-01.ogg
